name: sim.getTextureId
description: Retrieves the texture ID of a specific texture
luaSynopsis: int textureId, list resolution = sim.getTextureId(string textureName)
pythonSynopsis: int textureId, int[2] resolution = sim.getTextureId(string textureName)
inputs:
1. textureName: name of the texture ID to be retrieved
outputs:
1. textureId: the texture ID, or -1 if the texture does not exist
2. resolution: an array of 2 values representing the resolution of the texture
